Download the APP and discover the customized program dedicated to your needs!

Turbo.ua — ordering products to your home in Kyiv. The main advantage is the turbo speed of delivery - in just 15 minutes. So quickly, because there are Turbo.ua darkstores in every district, very close to your house.
At Turbo.ua you will find the essentials: bread, vegetables and meat. Things that suddenly ran out: batteries, shampoo, milk. And everything else that can be bought in a store near the house. But now products will be delivered directly to the door, and you can pay for them in any convenient way for you.

WHY US:
- Own: We are a Ukrainian IT company, we employ people who value time and improve the standard of living in their country;
- Fast: Delivery time - from 15 to 30 minutes with the possibility to track the status of your order online;
- Products for you: In addition to your favorite products, the assortment includes a large selection of organic, gluten-free, lactose-free and craft products of Ukrainian production;
- Quality: Every day our employees check the expiration date of products and the appearance of fruits and vegetables. We maintain a temperature of 2-4 °C in refrigerators in the store, -18 °C in freezers, and couriers are equipped with thermal bags;
- Pleasant: We have created a whole world of TurboLand for you, where you can exchange your bonuses for goods and even double cashback on your favorite categories;

Turbo.ua is available from 8:00 a.m. to 9:00 p.m. all year round except for Easter and Christmas, on these days we are like you and your family.
The service is available in several districts of Kyiv - check your address in the application and order more than two thousand goods to your door!

We’re Dodo Pizza. We’re in love with two things: Pizza and Tech. So, we’ve found a way to make the best pizza, make it affordable, and deliver fast.

All our pizzas have crunchy dough, we use fresh vegetables, creamy mozzarella, and a special sauce made from Italian tomatoes and spices. We are fans of quality, cleanliness, and safety and we have nothing to hide!

You can:

— combine pizza halves;

— tailor the recipe according to your preference;

— store the order history and delivery addresses;

— collect a cashback for each order.

Our first pizzeria opened in 2011, now we have over 950 stores in 18 countries such as Vietnam, Nigeria, the United Arab Emirates, Estonia, and a host of other countries. Try us! Download the App and order now.

